    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person Shooter with very detailed worlds. It includes Platforming and rooms with Puzzles that you need to solve in order to advance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person Shooting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive grenades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Spider Monsters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Golem Boss </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumps from building to building </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwater moments </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slightly obscured targets you need to find </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective: Reach and touch the checkered finish line at the far end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tip: Sometimes you need to shoot the targets before touching the goal post. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk: ASDW </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spacebar </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot: Left Mouse Button </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouch: Left Control </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: P</p>",
